<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR" class="scroll-smooth overflow-x-hidden" id="html-root">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Projeto Executivo de Acesso Facial | Cel.Lep – Vision</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Automação e Controle de Acesso Facial para o Portão da Nova Unidade Cel.Lep Vila Mariana – Vision Tecnologia">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#b9880e">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">

    <!-- Fonts & CDN Tailwind -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=League+Spartan:wght@700;800&family=Quicksand:wght@500;600;700&family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>

    <!-- Google Analytics 4 -->
    <script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-KTGEL92B0F"></script>
    <script>
      window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
      function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}
      gtag('js', new Date());
      gtag('config', 'G-KTGEL92B0F');
    </script>

    <!-- Microsoft Clarity -->
    <script type="text/javascript">
        (function(c,l,a,r,i,t,y){
            c[a]=c[a]||function(){(c[a].q=c[a].q||[]).push(arguments)};
            t=l.createElement(r);t.async=1;t.src="https://www.clarity.ms/tag/"+i;
            y=l.getElementsByTagName(r)[0];y.parentNode.insertBefore(t,y);
        })(window, document, "clarity", "script", "vifq10es5o");
    </script>

    <!-- Tailwind Configuração -->
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['"Outfit"', 'sans-serif'],
                        logo: ['"League Spartan"', 'sans-serif'],
                        tech: ['"Quicksand"', 'sans-serif'],
                    },
                    colors: {
                        brand: {
                            yellow: '#b9880e',
                            goldLight: '#FFDE59',
                            goldDark: '#8a6208',
                            black: '#09090b',
                        }
                    },
                    boxShadow: {
                        'glass': '0 4px 24px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.04)',
                        'premium': '0 16px 50px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.08)',
                        'glow': '0 0 20px rgba(185,136,14,0.18)',
                        'glow-md': '0 0 35px rgba(185,136,14,0.28)',
                    },
                    animation: {
                        'slide-up': 'slideUp 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1) forwards',
                        'float': 'float 6s ease-in-out infinite',
                        'fade-in': 'fadeIn 0.4s ease forwards',
                    },
                    keyframes: {
                        slideUp: {
                            '0%': { opacity: '0', transform: 'translateY(35px)' },
                            '100%': { opacity: '1', transform: 'translateY(0)' }
                        },
                        float: {
                            '0%,100%': { transform: 'translateY(0)' },
                            '50%': { transform: 'translateY(-10px)' }
                        },
                        fadeIn: {
                            '0%': { opacity: '0' },
                            '100%': { opacity: '1' }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>

    <style>
        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #f9fafb; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #d1d5db; border-radius: 4px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #b9880e; }

        .text-gold-shine {
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #b9880e 20%, #FFDE59 50%, #b9880e 80%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-size: 200% auto;
            animation: shine 4s linear infinite;
        }
        @keyframes shine { to { background-position: 200% center; } }

        .bg-grid {
            background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(185,136,14,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px),
                              linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(185,136,14,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 40px 40px;
        }
        .bg-dots {
            background-image: radial-gradient(#b9880e 1.2px, transparent 1.2px);
            background-size: 22px 22px;
            opacity: 0.035;
        }

        .lock-input {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            color: #b9880e;
            font-family: 'League Spartan', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            text-align: center;
            outline: none;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            letter-spacing: 0.18em;
            border-radius: 14px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .lock-input:focus {
            border-color: #b9880e;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(185,136,14,0.25);
        }
        .lock-input::placeholder {
            color: #71717a;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 400;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            text-transform: none;
        }

        .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1); }
        .reveal.active { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

        .accordion-content { max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; transition: max-height 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1); }
        .accordion-item.open .accordion-content { max-height: 600px; }
        .accordion-item.open .acc-arrow { transform: rotate(180deg); }
        .acc-arrow { transition: transform 0.3s; }

        /* Animação Contínua do Carrossel de Avaliações */
        @keyframes marqueeReviews {
            0% { transform: translateX(0); }
            100% { transform: translateX(-50%); }
        }
        .reviews-marquee-track {
            display: flex;
            width: max-content;
            animation: marqueeReviews 55s linear infinite;
            will-change: transform;
        }
        .reviews-marquee-container:hover .reviews-marquee-track,
        .reviews-marquee-track.paused {
            animation-play-state: paused !important;
        }

        .premium-border-glow {
            position: relative;
            border-radius: 2rem;
            padding: 2px;
            background-color: #b9880e;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(185,136,14,0.15);
            transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);
        }
        .premium-border-glow:hover { transform: scale(1.006); }
        .premium-border-glow::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            left: -50%;
            width: 200%;
            height: 200%;
            background: conic-gradient(
                from 0deg, 
                transparent 0deg, 
                transparent 175deg, 
                rgba(255, 222, 89, 0.6) 178deg, 
                #ffffff 180deg, 
                rgba(255, 222, 89, 0.6) 182deg, 
                transparent 185deg, 
                transparent 360deg
            );
            animation: rotate-border 12s linear infinite;
            z-index: 0;
        }
        @keyframes rotate-border {
            0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }
        .premium-border-inner {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: calc(2rem - 2px);
            height: 100%;
        }

        @media print {
            #lock-screen, #navbar, #cta-float { display: none !important; }
            .reveal { opacity: 1 !important; transform: none !important; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-[#fafafa] text-gray-800 antialiased overflow-hidden h-screen" id="body-root">

<!-- ===================== LOCK SCREEN ===================== -->
<div id="lock-screen" class="fixed inset-0 z-[100] bg-[#09090b] flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center p-4 transition-opacity duration-700 ease-out overflow-y-auto">
    <div class="bg-grid absolute inset-0 opacity-10 pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-yellow/5 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"></div>

    <!-- Logo -->
    <div class="relative flex flex-col items-center mb-8 z-10">
        <div class="relative flex items-baseline leading-none">
            <span class="font-logo font-bold text-[5rem] md:text-[5.5rem] text-gold-shine lowercase tracking-[-0.05em] leading-none">vısıon</span>
            <span class="absolute -right-5 top-4 text-[1.1rem] text-brand-yellow font-bold">®</span>
        </div>
        <span class="font-tech text-[1.0rem] font-bold text-zinc-500 lowercase -mt-4 ml-2.5 text-center w-full" style="letter-spacing:0.53em;">tecnologia</span>
    </div>

    <div class="w-full max-w-sm space-y-5 z-10">
        <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-brand-yellow/30 bg-brand-yellow/10 mb-2">
                <i data-lucide="lock" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-brand-yellow"></i>
                <span class="text-brand-yellow text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Acesso Corporativo Restrito</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-2xl">Cel.Lep Idiomas</h2>
            <p class="text-zinc-400 text-xs">Nova Unidade Vila Mariana • A/C Kauã (Compras)</p>
        </div>

        <div>
            <!-- SENHAS: KAUA2026, CELLEP2026, CELLEP, KAUA, VISION -->
            <input type="password" id="password-input" class="lock-input w-full py-4 px-4" placeholder="Digite sua senha de acesso" autocomplete="off">
            <p id="error-msg" class="text-red-400 text-xs mt-2 hidden">
                <span class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1"><i data-lucide="x-circle" class="w-4 h-4"></i> Senha incorreta. Tente novamente.</span>
            </p>
        </div>

        <button onclick="checkPassword()" id="btn-unlock" class="w-full bg-brand-yellow hover:bg-brand-goldLight text-black font-bold py-4 rounded-2xl transition-all shadow-glow flex items-center justify-center gap-2 group relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white/20 translate-y-full group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-300 rounded-2xl"></div>
            <i data-lucide="shield-check" class="w-5 h-5 relative z-10" id="unlock-icon"></i>
            <span class="relative z-10 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest font-bold" id="unlock-text">Acessar Proposta Técnica</span>
            <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="w-4 h-4 relative z-10 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" id="unlock-arrow"></i>
        </button>

        <p class="text-zinc-600 text-xs">Documento Confidencial B2B · Vision Tecnologia © 2026</p>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- ===================== NAVBAR ===================== -->
<nav id="navbar" class="fixed w-full z-50 top-0 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-xl border-b border-gray-200/50 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="flex justify-between h-20 items-center">
            
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 cursor-pointer" onclick="window.scrollTo({top:0, behavior:'smooth'})">
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
                    <div class="relative flex items-baseline leading-none">
                        <span class="font-logo font-bold text-[2.4rem] text-gold-shine lowercase tracking-[-0.05em] leading-none">vısıon</span>
                        <span class="absolute -right-2.5 top-1.5 text-[0.6rem] text-brand-yellow font-bold">®</span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="font-tech text-[0.55rem] font-bold text-gray-400 lowercase -mt-2 ml-1" style="letter-spacing:0.53em;">tecnologia</span>
                </div>
                <div class="h-7 w-px bg-gray-200 hidden sm:block"></div>
                <span class="text-zinc-400 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold hidden sm:block">Cel.Lep Vila Mariana</span>
            </div>

            <div class="hidden md:flex items-center space-x-7 text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider">
                <a href="#diagnostico" class="hover:text-brand-yellow transition-colors">Diagnóstico</a>
                <a href="#solucao" class="hover:text-brand-yellow transition-colors">Equipamentos</a>
                <a href="#video-demo" class="hover:text-brand-yellow transition-colors">Na Prática</a>
                <a href="#avaliacoes" class="hover:text-brand-yellow transition-colors">Avaliações</a>
                <a href="#investimento" class="hover:text-brand-yellow transition-colors">Investimento</a>
                <a href="#faq" class="hover:text-brand-yellow transition-colors">Dúvidas</a>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                <button onclick="window.print()" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-brand-yellow transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5" title="Salvar em PDF">
                    <i data-lucide="download" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                    <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest hidden sm:block">PDF</span>
                </button>
                <a href="#investimento" class="bg-zinc-900 text-white px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-brand-yellow hover:text-black transition-all shadow-md">
                    Ver Opções
                </a>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</nav>

<!-- ===================== HERO COM VÍDEO ===================== -->
<header class="pt-32 pb-20 lg:pt-40 relative overflow-hidden bg-[#f8f9fa]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-grid pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="absolute right-0 top-0 w-1/2 h-full bg-gradient-to-l from-white to-transparent z-0 pointer-events-none hidden lg:block"></div>
    
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 relative z-10">
        <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-12 lg:gap-16">
            
            <!-- Text Column -->
            <div class="w-full lg:w-[55%] text-center lg:text-left animate-slide-up">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-white border border-gray-200 text-gray-600 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-6 mx-auto lg:mx-0 shadow-sm">
                    <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></div>
                    Cliente <span class="text-brand-yellow font-black">Cel.Lep Idiomas</span> | Vila Mariana
                </div>
                
                <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-[3.4rem] font-extrabold text-gray-900 leading-[1.05] tracking-tight mb-6">
                    Automação e Acesso Facial para o portão da <span class="text-gold-shine">nova unidade Cel.Lep.</span>
                </h1>
                
                <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-gray-500 max-w-xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 font-medium leading-relaxed">
                    Kauã, analisamos as fotos da unidade na Rua Pedro de Toledo, 200. Como o imóvel está em plena reforma civil (fase de drywall e acabamento), <strong>o momento exato para lançar a infraestrutura zincada e fiação é agora</strong>, garantindo proteção contra vandalismo na calçada e preservando a pintura nova após a entrega.
                </p>

                <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-4">
                    <div class="flex -space-x-3">
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-white bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-600 shadow-xs"><i data-lucide="scan-face" class="w-4 h-4"></i></div>
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-white bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-600 shadow-xs"><i data-lucide="hard-hat" class="w-4 h-4"></i></div>
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-white bg-brand-yellow/20 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-goldDark shadow-xs"><i data-lucide="magnet" class="w-4 h-4"></i></div>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Execução Alinhada à Reforma Civil</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Video Player Column -->
            <div class="w-full lg:w-[45%] mt-4 lg:mt-0 reveal animate-slide-up" style="animation-delay: 200ms;">
                <div class="relative w-full max-w-lg mx-auto group z-10">
                    <div class="relative w-full aspect-video bg-black border-[6px] md:border-[10px] border-zinc-800 rounded-t-[1rem] md:rounded-t-[1.5rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
                        
                        <video id="vision-video" class="w-full h-full object-cover cursor-pointer opacity-90" autoplay muted loop playsinline>
                            <source src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dptcuckhf/video/upload/v1771711323/Vict%C3%B3ria_-_Vision_gdqnrk.mp4" type="video/mp4">
                        </video>
                        
                        <div id="unmute-overlay" class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/50 backdrop-blur-sm flex flex-col items-center justify-center cursor-pointer transition-opacity duration-500 z-30 hover:bg-black/40">
                            <div class="bg-brand-yellow text-black font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-full flex items-center gap-2 shadow-glow animate-pulse transform group-hover:scale-105 transition-all">
                                <i data-lucide="volume-2" class="w-4 h-4 fill-black"></i>
                                <span class="text-[10px] tracking-wide uppercase">Clique para Ouvir Apresentação</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="absolute top-1.5 md:top-2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-1.5 h-1.5 md:w-2 md:h-2 bg-zinc-950 rounded-full z-20"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative w-[114%] -ml-[7%] h-3 md:h-5 bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-300 to-zinc-400 rounded-b-xl md:rounded-b-2xl shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] flex justify-center border-t border-zinc-200">
                        <div class="w-1/5 h-1.5 md:h-2 bg-zinc-300 rounded-b-md shadow-inner"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Quick Stats -->
        <div class="mt-14 lg:mt-20 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto reveal">
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-glass border border-gray-100 text-center animate-float" style="animation-delay:0s;">
                <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-brand-yellow/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-2 text-brand-goldDark">
                    <i data-lucide="scan-face" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-gray-900">&lt;0.5s</div>
                <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Leitura Facial</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-glass border border-gray-100 text-center animate-float" style="animation-delay:0.8s;">
                <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-brand-yellow/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-2 text-brand-goldDark">
                    <i data-lucide="magnet" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-gray-900">150 kgf</div>
                <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Força Eletroímã</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-glass border border-gray-100 text-center animate-float" style="animation-delay:0.4s;">
                <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-brand-yellow/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-2 text-brand-goldDark">
                    <i data-lucide="battery-charging" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-gray-900">Nobreak</div>
                <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Bateria VRLA</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-glass border border-gray-100 text-center animate-float" style="animation-delay:1.2s;">
                <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-brand-yellow/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-2 text-brand-goldDark">
                    <i data-lucide="shield-check" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-gray-900">12 Meses</div>
                <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Garantia Total</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</header>

<!-- ===================== DIAGNÓSTICO DO CENÁRIO ===================== -->
<section id="diagnostico" class="py-24 bg-white border-y border-gray-200/60 relative">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="text-center mb-16 reveal">
            <span class="text-brand-yellow font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs">Engenharia Consultiva & Vistoria</span>
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-3 leading-tight">Diagnóstico Técnico: Análise do Local em Obra</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-500 mt-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
                <strong>Kauã</strong>, a partir da vistoria técnica e da análise visual do imóvel na <strong>Rua Pedro de Toledo, 200</strong>, estruturamos a implantação para tirar proveito da fase atual de reforma civil:
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Banner de Oportunidade da Obra -->
        <div class="mb-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto p-4 md:p-5 rounded-2xl bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 flex items-center gap-4 reveal">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-yellow text-black flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-sm">
                <i data-lucide="hard-hat" class="w-6 h-6"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="text-left text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-800 leading-relaxed">
                <strong class="text-gray-950 block text-sm md:text-base font-bold mb-0.5">Janela de Oportunidade da Reforma Civil:</strong>
                O ambiente interno encontra-se em fase de drywall, massas e fechamento. Lançar os eletrodutos e a fiação de rede em paralelo com a equipe da obra evita perfurações posteriores, retrabalho ou cortes na pintura finalizada.
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 reveal">
            <!-- Pilar 1 -->
            <div class="bg-[#fafafa] rounded-[2rem] p-8 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-brand-yellow/40 transition-all">
                <div>
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-brand-goldDark">
                        <i data-lucide="shield" class="w-6 h-6"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Infraestrutura Blindada em Aço Zincado</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-xs md:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
                        Com fachada em parede de pedra e calçada com piso intertravado, o cabeamento não pode ficar vulnerável. Dimensionamos eletrodutos e conduletes em <strong>aço galvanizado 3/4</strong> aparente com tampões cegos, blindando a passagem contra umidade, atrito e vandalismo.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="p-3.5 bg-emerald-50 rounded-xl border border-emerald-100 text-xs text-emerald-800 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i data-lucide="check-circle-2" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0"></i>
                    <span>15 eletrodutos 3/4 + 10 conduletes + cabo UTP homologado.</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Pilar 2 -->
            <div class="bg-[#fafafa] rounded-[2rem] p-8 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-brand-yellow/40 transition-all">
                <div>
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-brand-goldDark">
